  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/e306d0edaa1c360a9dc63af39b3f34da9440d14853e714d54d6553647fbc3ba8.png] \n\nGiven equation: 84 ÷ 6 + 9 - 12 × 3 = 41\n\nOption 1) − and ×\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ 84 ÷ 6 + __**9 × 12**__ **__-__** 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 14 + 9 × 12 - 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 14 + 108 - 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 122 - 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 119 = 41\n\nOption 2) ÷ and ×\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ __**84 × 6**__ + 9 - __**12 ÷ 3**__ = 41\n\n⇒ 84 × 6 + 9 - 4 = 41\n\n⇒ 504 + 9 - 4 = 41\n\n⇒ 514 - 4 = 41\n\n⇒ 510 = 41\n\nOption 3) + and ×\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ 84 ÷ __**6 × 9**__ - __**12 + 3**__ = 41\n\n⇒ 14 × 9 - 12 + 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 126 - 12 + 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 129 - 12 = 41\n\n⇒ 117 = 41\n\n**Option 4) − and +**\n\nAfter interchanging the signs:\n\n⇒ 84 ÷ __**6 - 9 **__+ 12 × 3 = 41\n\n⇒ 14 - 9 + __**12 × 3**__ = 41\n\n⇒ __**14**__ - 9 __**+ 36**__ = 41\n\n⇒ 50 - 9 = 41\n\n**⇒ 41 = 41**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"− and +\".",
